    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888470/extras/58947bce112930b8d72001ba74b6a82d.avif?t=1752834304\" /></div>Storyline:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tyrant Quest is an erotic, dark fantasy visual novel about a Dark Lord who seeks revenge after being sealed away for a hundred years. But an important artifact was stolen from him, and without it, he is too weak to defeat his enemies. And so he sets out with his last loyal subject, the succubus Lili, seeking a way to regain his power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, he will find new servants and meet new enemies. Among them, maybe he will encounter a mistress worthy of ruling by his side, and maybe he will build a harem fitting the Dark Lord. But whatever he does, he will have his revenge--or he will die trying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Content:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888470/extras/62e3eb712b4062f6e205adf61111289d.webp?t=1752834304\" /></div> Play an eroge with a long and intense storyline, with 15+ hours of gameplay featuring deeply developed characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888470/extras/62e3eb712b4062f6e205adf61111289d.webp?t=1752834304\" /></div> Several romances are available, each with several intimate scenes to get your heart racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888470/extras/62e3eb712b4062f6e205adf61111289d.webp?t=1752834304\" /></div> Every decision counts: would you be kind and good or harsh and cold with your companions? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888470/extras/62e3eb712b4062f6e205adf61111289d.webp?t=1752834304\" /></div> A total of <strong>7 different endings</strong>, including the possibility of establishing a harem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888470/extras/62e3eb712b4062f6e205adf61111289d.webp?t=1752834304\" /></div> Over <strong>58 erotic scenes</strong> in CG for your viewing pleasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888470/extras/62e3eb712b4062f6e205adf61111289d.webp?t=1752834304\" /></div> Sophisticated sound effects and original music to enhance the immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Main Characters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888470/extras/d7d225c8767e7d2ed6bf07b43b13d86a.avif?t=1752834304\" /></div><strong>Lili\u00a0</strong>is a succubus once bound to the Dark Lord\u2019s former partner. After reviving him to fulfill her mistress\u2019s last wish, she chooses to stay by his side. Though her motives begin as duty, she finds herself drawn to his ambition, and possibly something more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888470/extras/4f3ef43d4a1ead5a3f71514d3ff21b1a.avif?t=1752834304\" /></div><strong>Seren</strong> is the last descendant of the Dark Lord\u2019s former lover. A gifted witch driven by revenge, she joins his cause to serve her own goals. As their paths intertwine, she begins to question whether her connection to the past is coincidence or something deeper she must confront.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888470/extras/80826c44356f611cd1da6e9d9e264983.avif?t=1752834304\" /></div><strong>Elanor</strong> is the princess of the elf kingdom, and after being taken to the Dark Lord\u2019s domain, she finds herself in unfamiliar territory alongside her loyal bodyguard, Rin. Though gentle and idealistic, Elanor begins to question what she knows as she spends time with her former enemy. As new perspectives challenge her beliefs, she must decide whether to stay true to her upbringing or follow her evolving feelings in an unexpected direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888470/extras/b562ff80f87eaf345f489c5dda3ad638.avif?t=1752834304\" /></div><strong>Rin</strong> is a skilled swordswoman from a distant land and the devoted protector of Princess Elanor. Fiercely independent and unwavering in her duty, Rin is determined to resist the influence of the Dark Lord. Yet beneath her strong exterior lies a quiet longing, and if faced with the chance to pursue the one she secretly desires, she may find herself torn between loyalty and love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888470/extras/a7e21c36d14255e12214f73d71333c2e.avif?t=1752834304\" /></div><strong>Ancalia</strong> is a powerful dragon sealed into human form by Camellia, the high priestess who once subdued the Dark Lord. Though not interested in mortal conflicts, she is tied to Camellia\u2019s cause by ancient vows. But her opinions shift as she observes the Dark Lord\u2019s actions, and whether as enemy or ally, her decision will be her own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888470/extras/71bc9fd0d1c61ad1ff876a0dc8b970a9.avif?t=1752834304\" /></div><strong>Camellia</strong> is the heir to the priestess who once sealed the Dark Lord away one hundred years ago. Now she watches his return with growing interest, determined to shape his fate. Whether through persuasion or confrontation, she intends to test his strength and his resolve.</p>",
